# Innap — design system (hotel admin)

Tokens live in `INNAP_DESIGN_SYSTEM_FOR_NEXTJS.txt` and `app/globals.css`. Do not invent a new palette.

## Brand tokens

- Primary `#1362FC` · hover `#034bd9` · secondary `#627EEA`
- Page BG `#f5f5f5` · chrome BG `#FCFCFC` · border `#F2F2F2`
- Text title `#000` · muted `#969ba0` · header icons `#464a53`
- Success `#37D159` · warning `#FFC368` · danger `#FF6746` · info `#b48dd3`
- Radius `0.625rem` (10px)
- Fonts: Roboto (UI) · Poppins (headings / charts) via `font-sans` / `font-display`
- Sidebar width `20.5rem` · header height `--header-height` (5.5rem)

## Chrome

- Sidebar + header: light `#FCFCFC` (`bg-chrome`), active menu `bg-primary` white text
- Content: `bg-background` (`#f5f5f5`)
- Dark mode: body `#212529`, chrome `#2a2e32` — keep primary blue

## Page shell (required on dashboard screens)

```tsx
import {
  PageHeader,
  PageSection,
  PageShell,
  PageShellContent,
} from "@/components/shared";

<PageShell className="h-full">
  <PageHeader title="Page Title" description="..." />
  <PageShellContent>
    <PageSection title="Section">{/* fields / tables */}</PageSection>
  </PageShellContent>
</PageShell>
```

- Dashboard home: `PageShell flush` + KPI cards; still use `PageHeader` / `PageSection`
- Auth: `AuthShell` only (no PageShell)
- Fields: `common/formFields` · `h-10 rounded-[0.625rem]`
- Tables: `components/ui/table` + soft border; separate Toolbar / Table / Dialogs
- Loading: shared `PageLoader` from `@/components/shared` (`page` | `section` | `inline` | `button`)
- List/CRUD screens: `ListPageFrame` + `ListToolbar` + `EmptyState` (same chrome on every org page)
- Page scrolling: shadcn `ScrollArea` via `PageShellContent` and table region in `ListPageFrame`

## Do not

- Navy `#00264D` / teal `#14B8A6` chrome
- Hand-roll headers/sections instead of `components/shared`
- Business logic in presentational components
- Hardcode API base URLs
